{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The sun has set, and the dead are hungry...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight to survive in 3 locations<strong>.</strong>  a ruined city, a lonely gas station, and the tunnels below. Each map grows harder the longer you last, with faster, stronger, and more relentless hordes closing in from every direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No allies. No rescue. No end.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 playable maps: City, Gas Station, and Tunnels.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless waves of zombies.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanding difficulty and randomized zombie spawns.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tight, fast-paced first-person combat.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive as long as you can and chase your highest wave.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable and purchasable (in game currency) weapons.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>How long will you last <i>After Dark</i>?</u></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wave 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104020/b01bc70fd070fc7308d67ca07e94fd36c47f816d.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104020/b01bc70fd070fc7308d67ca07e94fd36c47f816d.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104020/b01bc70fd070fc7308d67ca07e94fd36c47f816d.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4104020/b01bc70fd070fc7308d67ca07e94fd36c47f816d.jpg"},{"name":"Wave 7","path":"https://cdn.